{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854720/extras/3c744768b87aed18592732fcc62cdccd.avif?t=1752935963\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf34\u2728 <strong>Welcome to your own slice of paradise!</strong> \ud83d\ude97\ud83c\udf0a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've inherited a run-down carwash by the sea. It's up to you (and your elemental magic!) to transform it into a thriving business. Explore a vibrant island filled with quirky locals eager to befriend you, dive into hidden ocean depths, and uncover dazzling coral reefs. Adventure, friendship, love, and enchantment await on your magical island journey! \ud83d\udc20\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean. Build. Explore. Unlock Magical Power. Craft. Relax. Your future, and the future of your carwash is what you make of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854720/extras/599792a8551e6e38c3a24f35af9ef76f.avif?t=1752935963\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Dream Carwash</strong>\u00a0<br>Transform a run-down carwash into a bustling, thriving business! Design your ideal layout, select top-notch equipment, hire unique employees, and optimize traffic flow to maximize profits and customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create Your Own Island Adventure</strong><br> Island life is laid-back\u2014but your journey doesn't have to be! Spend your days leisurely enjoying island life, diving deep into adventures, building meaningful relationships, or dedicating your energy to growing your carwash empire. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Harness the Elements</strong> <br>Unlock powerful elemental abilities to enhance your island experience. Each new skill provides exciting opportunities to upgrade your carwash, beautify your surroundings, and uncover hidden secrets around the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Befriend a Vibrant Cast of Islanders</strong> <br>Meet and build relationships with a diverse group of island residents. Engage in heartfelt conversations, learn about their dreams, impress them, and perhaps even recruit some as part of your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find Your Perfect Match</strong> <br>Connect deeply, charm islanders, and forge lasting relationships. Romance is waiting\u2014who will capture your heart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Restore Paradise</strong> <br>Help rejuvenate the island to its former glory! Participate in community projects, enhance town beauty, and develop exciting attractions to draw more tourists. As the island thrives, so does your carwash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enjoy Island Life</strong> <br>Experience the joys of island living! Search for unique shells, capture intriguing insects, or fish along serene beaches\u2014fun and relaxation are always just steps away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Express Yourself</strong> <br>Personalize your character with a vast selection of outfits, accessories, and physiques. Discover countless combinations to show off your unique style and personality\u2014be whoever you aspire to be!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into Adventure</strong> <br>Explore vibrant coral reefs teeming with marine life or venture deep into underwater caverns to mine precious gemstones. These exciting explorations offer valuable resources to amplify your elemental magic and upgrade your carwash equipment.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854720?t=1752935963","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854720?t=1752935963","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854720/af4a2b6511b0abcb73c26ce0f84b5d5c61da29c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752935963","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854720/af4a2b6511b0abcb73c26ce0f84b5d5c61da29c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752935963","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854720/extras/3c744768b87aed18592732fcc62cdccd.avif?t=1752935963\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf34\u2728 <strong>Welcome to your own slice of paradise!</strong> \ud83d\ude97\ud83c\udf0a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've inherited a run-down carwash by the sea. It's up to you (and your elemental magic!) to transform it into a thriving business. Explore a vibrant island filled with quirky locals eager to befriend you, dive into hidden ocean depths, and uncover dazzling coral reefs. Adventure, friendship, love, and enchantment await on your magical island journey! \ud83d\udc20\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean. Build. Explore. Unlock Magical Power. Craft. Relax. Your future, and the future of your carwash is what you make of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s