><strong>Enjoy Island Life</strong> <br>Experience the joys of island living! Search for unique shells, capture intriguing insects, or fish along serene beaches\u2014fun and relaxation are always just steps away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Express Yourself</strong> <br>Personalize your character with a vast selection of outfits, accessories, and physiques. Discover countless combinations to show off your unique style and personality\u2014be whoever you aspire to be!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into Adventure</strong> <br>Explore vibrant coral reefs teeming with marine life or venture deep into underwater caverns to mine precious gemstones. These exciting explorations offer valuable resources to amplify your elemental magic and upgrade your carwash equipment.</p>","developers":["JoeKomputer"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854720/119041460f4cef057e346d751f66d5754c839316/header.jpg?t=1752935963","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 15.0+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1, Intel Core</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 15.0+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1, Intel Core</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257169389,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169389/movie480.mp4?t=1752674225","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169389/movie_max.mp4?t=1752674225"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257169389/d3b264ee082f97f3ac40cc6cd4325d4a8bca93db/movie_